# tanacloud.com — short links
#
# Cloudflare Pages reads this file. Unlike .htaccess it is a NORMAL filename,
# so nothing can silently drop it on deploy.
#
# TO ADD A NEW SHORT LINK: add TWO lines below — with and without the
# trailing slash. Cloudflare matches the path literally, so /h3 does NOT
# also match /h3/, and a trailing slash would 404.
#   /<slug>    <destination URL>   301
#   /<slug>/   <destination URL>   301
#
# ⚠️ Do NOT also create a <slug>/index.html page. On Cloudflare Pages a real
#    static file WINS over a redirect rule, so the page would shadow the 301
#    and the short link would stop redirecting properly.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# SHORT LINKS  →  external destinations
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
/h3    https://tana.pub/wqgY88cFfOJd/geospatial-data-science-with-ubers-h3   301
/h3/   https://tana.pub/wqgY88cFfOJd/geospatial-data-science-with-ubers-h3   301

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep repo housekeeping files out of the served site
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
/README.md    /   301
/.gitignore   /   301
